OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters warned over RNLI
OL,4,Adisruption risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters planning action that could
OL,7,Fdisrupt the RNLI's work have been told
OL,8,Fto "carefully consider the
OL,9,Fimplications" by Sussex Police.
OL,11,FIn Dover on Saturday, "stop the boat"
OL,12,Fprotesters blocked the town's port,
OL,13,Fwhile in Portsmouth on Sunday,
OL,14,Fdemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,15,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying
OL,16,Fmigrants that had arrived by boat.
OL,18,FFollowing this, some crew members from
OL,19,Fthe incident in Portsmouth had their
OL,20,Fphotos and names shared on social media
OL,21,Fin posts accusing them of treason.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
