OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters warned over RNLI
OL,4,Adisruption risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Adam McCaig said: "We would
OL,7,Fadvise anyone considering carrying out
OL,8,Fany action that could hinder the RNLI's
OL,9,Fvital lifesaving work to carefully
OL,10,Fconsider the implications."
